WEBVTT

00:00:51.430 --> 00:00:55.060
Michael, we lost Muroi. Can you do anything on your end to find him?

00:01:12.720 --> 00:01:14.180
Who the hell are you?

00:01:18.760 --> 00:01:20.750
Oh, you're one of them, huh?!

00:01:26.870 --> 00:01:27.560
What the...?

00:02:05.740 --> 00:02:08.590
I feel like it'll disappear...

00:02:08.420 --> 00:02:14.320
...the instant I look away.

00:02:16.670 --> 00:02:19.460
I just kept counting...

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:24.900
...all the many traces of loneliness...

00:02:24.860 --> 00:02:32.270
...that I'd vomited up.

00:02:32.330 --> 00:02:38.210
In this time that seems so dry,

00:02:38.150 --> 00:02:43.320
...my heart is thrashing around and drowning.

00:02:43.250 --> 00:02:49.180
It takes those lies that make my head spin...

00:02:49.090 --> 00:02:52.230
...and tears them to pieces.

00:02:52.060 --> 00:03:01.900
 And the place I lose my way in...

00:03:04.430 --> 00:03:09.730
...is a dim, hazy world.

00:04:03.390 --> 00:04:07.380
It seems like we and HQ haven't been on very good terms since the attack.

00:04:08.160 --> 00:04:10.590
I don't have much information on what's going on over there.

00:04:11.030 --> 00:04:14.760
But there isn't anywhere else that Amon could be.

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:17.300
Well, you might be right...

00:04:17.640 --> 00:04:19.100
You were the one who told me, right?

00:04:19.100 --> 00:04:22.770
There was a huge bloodstain on the ground from where Amon was dragged away.

00:04:22.770 --> 00:04:23.740
Yeah...

00:04:24.640 --> 00:04:29.600
But Karasuma and the others said it wasn't enough to be life-threatening.

00:04:30.380 --> 00:04:31.710
So he's at headquarters, then.

00:04:32.320 --> 00:04:34.290
If he's alive, that is.

00:04:34.650 --> 00:04:35.590
Michael, that's...

00:04:35.590 --> 00:04:36.420
Shh!

00:04:39.290 --> 00:04:40.260
We're clear.

00:04:41.530 --> 00:04:42.690
He's alive.

00:04:44.330 --> 00:04:46.460
Amon isn't dead.

00:04:47.930 --> 00:04:49.420
What makes you think that?

00:04:50.070 --> 00:04:53.270
I don't know, but... No, that's not right.

00:04:53.870 --> 00:04:58.140
I just can't believe it. I can't believe Amon could be dead.

00:04:58.540 --> 00:04:59.600
Robin...

00:05:01.550 --> 00:05:03.510
I guess you have a point.

00:05:05.550 --> 00:05:10.080
Oh, right, that reminds me. I came across some information while I was accessing HQ.

00:05:10.390 --> 00:05:13.820
It looks like a new hunter is being sent here soon.

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:15.860
A replacement?

00:05:15.860 --> 00:05:17.990
No, I didn't get that impression.

00:05:18.330 --> 00:05:20.890
But you said you and headquarters weren't getting along.

00:05:21.200 --> 00:05:22.670
Yeah. Strange, huh?

00:05:23.070 --> 00:05:25.000
And the fact that I was able to snoop out...

00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:28.000
...that particular piece of intel is awfully suspicious.

00:05:28.810 --> 00:05:29.810
It was deliberate?

00:05:29.810 --> 00:05:31.780
Yeah, probably.

00:05:32.080 --> 00:05:35.710
Oh, right. Do you know anything about a hunter named Sastre?

00:05:38.520 --> 00:05:39.680
Sastre...!

00:05:58.240 --> 00:05:59.730
They said Muroi's been killed?

00:06:00.640 --> 00:06:03.140
Other than a puncture wound from a sharp object,

00:06:03.140 --> 00:06:05.440
...there's apparently nothing unusual about the body.

00:06:05.910 --> 00:06:07.570
We can't get involved yet.

00:06:08.010 --> 00:06:09.170
What's Michael say?

00:06:09.810 --> 00:06:11.280
I've been trying to reach him for a while.

00:06:11.580 --> 00:06:13.990
He's not there? That's unusual.

00:06:13.990 --> 00:06:15.420
Maybe he's sleeping.

00:06:16.020 --> 00:06:19.980
At any rate, if we don't get the corpse to the Factory before it's sent in for an autopsy...

00:06:20.290 --> 00:06:23.660
Hey, don't look at me. I'm no good at that sort of thing.

00:06:24.500 --> 00:06:27.160
No one's asking you to.

00:06:51.620 --> 00:06:54.110
Hello, Nagira Law Offices.

00:06:55.460 --> 00:06:56.720
Mr. Nagira?

00:06:57.000 --> 00:06:58.760
I'm sorry, but he's...

00:07:05.470 --> 00:07:07.810
She's an acquaintance of yours, right?

00:07:07.810 --> 00:07:08.930
Not really.

00:07:10.640 --> 00:07:12.410
All right. I'll buy it.

00:07:13.310 --> 00:07:17.870
Apparently, there was an origami crane left next to the body that was found last night.

00:07:18.520 --> 00:07:21.280
And this name was written on it.

00:07:29.530 --> 00:07:32.360
Sastre... Is he here to hunt me?

00:07:52.650 --> 00:07:55.810
In other words, you're telling me that Orbo's effectiveness on humans...

00:07:56.120 --> 00:07:58.350
...is still limited at this stage.

00:07:58.760 --> 00:08:02.320
Based on the results of our analysis of that last hunt,

00:08:02.830 --> 00:08:07.130
...a 30% drop in efficiency can be seen when compared to normal hunters.

00:08:07.470 --> 00:08:08.630
And...

00:08:09.470 --> 00:08:10.500
And what?

00:08:10.500 --> 00:08:14.270
We've observed some damage in some of the team members...

00:08:14.270 --> 00:08:16.570
...that seems to be a side-effect of Orbo use.

00:08:16.570 --> 00:08:17.630
Damage?

00:08:21.510 --> 00:08:25.970
So, we'll still need the hunters' powers for a while yet...

00:08:37.560 --> 00:08:38.590
You're off your crutches?

00:08:38.900 --> 00:08:43.770
Yeah. I'd like to say that I'm back at 100%, but I guess I'm still a little slow.

00:08:44.340 --> 00:08:45.340
Where is everybody?

00:08:45.340 --> 00:08:48.460
I think Karasuma and Dojima are still working last night's case.

00:08:49.270 --> 00:08:50.540
And the Chief and Hattori?

00:08:50.540 --> 00:08:54.910
Beats me. Those two have been heading out somewhere a lot lately.

00:08:58.680 --> 00:08:59.880
Oh, welcome back.

00:09:00.220 --> 00:09:01.150
Hey.

00:09:01.790 --> 00:09:03.910
Hana, have you seen Robin today?

00:09:04.290 --> 00:09:06.780
No, I haven't seen her at all today.

00:09:07.260 --> 00:09:09.160
And anyway, its been Robin this, Robin that lately!

00:09:09.160 --> 00:09:14.150
Could you PLEASE stop chasing skirts for a while and do a little work?!

00:09:14.630 --> 00:09:18.770
Listen, how many cases have you personally worked on these past few days?

00:09:18.770 --> 00:09:19.960
The clients have been complaining about...

00:09:30.450 --> 00:09:32.350
It's me. Can I come in?

00:09:37.090 --> 00:09:38.450
Last night?

00:09:38.960 --> 00:09:41.820
Yeah. A man was killed.

00:09:42.660 --> 00:09:44.180
Why are you telling me?

00:09:46.160 --> 00:09:49.220
Apparently, an origami crane was left by the body.

00:09:53.440 --> 00:09:55.340
I don't know if this is true or not,

00:09:55.670 --> 00:09:59.670
...but I hear that your name was written inside the crane for some reason.

00:10:01.110 --> 00:10:02.510
It's Sastre.

00:10:02.510 --> 00:10:05.480
Sastre? Who's that?

00:10:06.680 --> 00:10:08.820
A hunter from Solomon headquarters.

00:10:08.820 --> 00:10:11.290
From headquarters? What's he doing here, then?

00:10:11.660 --> 00:10:12.820
It was a message.

00:10:13.260 --> 00:10:14.520
Message?

00:10:15.090 --> 00:10:19.690
That's how Sastre always hunts down his Witches.

00:10:20.570 --> 00:10:25.090
He hunts another Witch, and then leaves a message.

00:10:26.040 --> 00:10:28.210
"You're going to end up like this."

00:10:28.210 --> 00:10:32.230
So you're saying that last night's killing was just his way of saying hello?

00:10:32.910 --> 00:10:36.870
Hey, wait a minute. That means the person he's really after is...

00:10:38.920 --> 00:10:40.080
Damn.

00:10:41.050 --> 00:10:44.080
Anyway, I'll do some more digging on this killing.

00:10:45.260 --> 00:10:46.990
You can get depressed after that.

00:11:11.180 --> 00:11:12.620
No doubt about it.

00:11:12.980 --> 00:11:14.780
Sastre is...

00:11:19.390 --> 00:11:23.020
I'm... being hunted.

00:11:27.670 --> 00:11:29.000
The Arcanum...?

00:11:29.530 --> 00:11:33.330
Right... The Arcanum is my only hope right now.

00:11:40.480 --> 00:11:41.840
Looking for the Arcanum?

00:11:51.160 --> 00:11:55.590
If you had the Arcanum, you might be able to beat that Sastre guy, right?

00:11:58.530 --> 00:11:59.290
I see.

00:12:00.100 --> 00:12:02.790
That thought occurred to me, too, but...

00:12:08.770 --> 00:12:10.040
I got careless.

00:12:10.880 --> 00:12:15.540
To this day, that thing is still thought of as the Holy Grail in Witch circles.

00:12:17.050 --> 00:12:18.410
It was stolen?

00:12:18.850 --> 00:12:20.650
What else could it be?

00:12:21.520 --> 00:12:22.920
But I...

00:12:23.790 --> 00:12:25.850
It's too early to throw in the towel.

00:12:26.520 --> 00:12:28.580
I have a good idea where it went.

00:12:31.100 --> 00:12:32.190
W-Wait a minute!

00:12:32.430 --> 00:12:36.920
The S-Splinter of Knowledge, right? You're after it too?

00:12:39.470 --> 00:12:41.170
Am I right?

00:12:41.340 --> 00:12:44.830
All right, I'll talk! I'll tell you everything I know.

00:12:45.180 --> 00:12:47.140
So let me go, okay?

00:13:20.680 --> 00:13:23.110
Another crane with Robin's name on it?

00:13:23.810 --> 00:13:24.840
Probably.

00:13:25.980 --> 00:13:27.780
Looks like your leg is okay.

00:13:28.120 --> 00:13:30.310
Yeah. It still hurts, though.

00:13:30.790 --> 00:13:32.090
It's all the rehab.

00:13:33.020 --> 00:13:35.390
Do you think it means OUR Robin?

00:13:35.760 --> 00:13:40.360
I don't know. But it would be crazy to think that it isn't.

00:13:40.970 --> 00:13:42.730
By the way, where's Dojima?

00:13:43.100 --> 00:13:45.400
I have no idea where she wandered off to.

00:13:46.640 --> 00:13:50.540
Geez, when is this case gonna come under our jurisdiction?

00:13:50.980 --> 00:13:52.440
It can't be helped.

00:13:52.440 --> 00:13:56.610
Other than the fact that the victim was a Witch, there's no grounds for us to step in.

00:13:57.180 --> 00:13:58.910
Yeah, but if the Administrator were here...

00:14:00.080 --> 00:14:00.790
What is it?

00:14:00.790 --> 00:14:02.880
I've tracked down the victim's recent movements.

00:14:03.350 --> 00:14:06.410
It looks like the Walled City was his base of operations.

00:14:06.890 --> 00:14:07.950
Walled City?

00:14:08.290 --> 00:14:11.920
Michael, can you do some digging and find out what he was doing there?

00:14:12.500 --> 00:14:15.590
I figured you'd ask that, so I'm looking into his known associates right now.

00:14:16.170 --> 00:14:18.400
For the time being, you should head over there yourself.

00:14:19.100 --> 00:14:20.040
Roger that.

00:14:33.350 --> 00:14:34.410
Come back here, you bastard!

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:46.190
All right, you out-of-shape bastard!

00:14:47.300 --> 00:14:49.160
I-I'm sorry, I'm sorry!

00:14:49.670 --> 00:14:51.860
Oh, I get it... I had a feeling it was you.

00:14:52.470 --> 00:14:55.630
You got the word out that the Splinter of Knowledge was at my place.

00:14:56.110 --> 00:14:59.770
I-It wasn't me! I didn't spread any rumors!

00:15:00.480 --> 00:15:01.600
I just...

00:15:01.980 --> 00:15:03.280
Just what?

00:15:04.720 --> 00:15:06.740
Well? Who'd you sell it to?

00:15:09.990 --> 00:15:11.450
Hello, Nagira Law...

00:15:11.990 --> 00:15:13.180
Oh, hello, Mr. Nagira.

00:15:13.690 --> 00:15:18.460
Oh, that girl? No, she hasn't come down yet today.

00:15:24.970 --> 00:15:26.040
That you, Robin?

00:15:26.040 --> 00:15:28.510
I've got it. Like I thought, it's in the Walled City.

00:15:29.010 --> 00:15:32.310
Looks like a guy they call the Priest has it.

00:15:32.310 --> 00:15:37.610
Stealing it was one thing, but he must not have had any clue how to use it.

00:15:37.980 --> 00:15:42.080
Apparently, he's poking around the old lady's place for the secret to it.

00:15:42.620 --> 00:15:45.760
If we get the rumor out there, they'll come flocking to us.

00:15:45.760 --> 00:15:48.220
Yes, just like hyenas.

00:15:54.670 --> 00:15:59.690
Looks like another idiot was drawn out by this thing.

00:16:02.610 --> 00:16:05.730
He doesn't seem to know how to introduce himself.

00:16:06.980 --> 00:16:10.210
Go teach him some manners. Be careful and thorough about it.

00:16:23.630 --> 00:16:25.420
Hey. I've been waiting for you.

00:16:27.300 --> 00:16:28.460
Let's go.

00:17:00.700 --> 00:17:02.530
Doesn't look like he's here.

00:17:21.820 --> 00:17:23.150
Is that him?

00:17:25.990 --> 00:17:27.890
Just waiting, Robin.

00:17:28.590 --> 00:17:29.720
Robin?

00:17:31.330 --> 00:17:32.450
Sastre...

00:17:33.060 --> 00:17:34.190
That's him?

00:17:34.530 --> 00:17:36.830
Crap, he got the drop on us?

00:17:37.330 --> 00:17:40.300
I must really be losing my edge.

00:17:51.720 --> 00:17:55.170
Robin, I'll hold him off! Get out of here!

00:17:56.450 --> 00:17:57.390
Crap!

00:19:07.690 --> 00:19:08.660
Nagira!

00:19:20.940 --> 00:19:22.600
Why are you after me?

00:19:27.950 --> 00:19:28.840
What is it?

00:19:29.250 --> 00:19:31.240
I'm not sure, but it...

00:19:33.080 --> 00:19:36.540
A psychic burst...? This way!

00:20:12.160 --> 00:20:13.120
Wha...?

00:20:19.730 --> 00:20:20.750
I can see it...

00:20:27.910 --> 00:20:29.840
The inner secrets of the Craft...

00:20:42.090 --> 00:20:43.050
Robin?

00:20:47.960 --> 00:20:49.980
I can see his element of air...

00:20:58.670 --> 00:21:00.760
You burned the Arcanum.

00:21:01.510 --> 00:21:02.440
Now I see.

00:21:02.440 --> 00:21:06.380
The true Craft... power derived from the elements...

00:21:06.380 --> 00:21:10.970
...was lying dormant inside my body, not in some Arcanum splinter.

00:21:14.550 --> 00:21:16.380
That's why you attacked me.

00:21:31.070 --> 00:21:34.700
Tell me. What about me makes me a Witch?

00:21:52.720 --> 00:21:53.690
Robin!

00:21:54.290 --> 00:21:55.350
Don't go to her!

00:21:58.960 --> 00:21:59.830
Amon!

00:21:59.830 --> 00:22:00.890
Mr. Amon!

00:22:02.270 --> 00:22:05.670
Robin isn't a hunter anymore. She's a Witch.

00:22:15.550 --> 00:22:17.910
Amon, what're you...

00:22:36.840 --> 00:22:44.830
Just how far back do I need to go?

00:22:44.650 --> 00:22:47.690
Tell me.

00:22:48.900 --> 00:22:59.680
It's all so vivid that it hurts.

00:23:00.540 --> 00:23:09.570
The truth is, nothing can be shared,

00:23:09.250 --> 00:23:14.060
...so I never looked back.

00:23:15.330 --> 00:23:19.430
...all those promises...

00:23:21.370 --> 00:23:25.830
...inside me eventually...

00:23:25.120 --> 00:23:31.630
...gave up on that light from some other time,

00:23:30.830 --> 00:23:40.410
...like the light of a morning you can't return to.
